o traps for whoever does it:\n\nTRAP 1 (I-1664, localisation emptied by outer forall): RelPicBaseLocalTriviality.lean ships per-prime localisation reductions (relPicMk-equal => picClass-equal after base change to Localization.Away f near every prime q). Honest infrastructure now, but when composed into a proof of RankOneDivisorUniqueness (forall S ...), verify the glue-back-to-global-equality over S is REAL local-to-global (covering Spec S), not the trivial f=1 converse the consumer's own forall-S already ranges over.\n\nTRAP 2 (abel non-injectivity vs I-1721 re-spelling): Pic0ChartAbelNonInjective proves abelSigmaChartAff is NON-injective when genus<degree (off the rank-one locus). A discharge must exhibit the PicRankOneOpen restriction as the GENUINE reason injectivity is restored (rank-one = single-point linear systems), and must NOT restate uniqueness as its own hypothesis via a datum-section-extraction lemma that only renames the goal.", "labels": ["agent-ready"], "status": "archived", "scope": {"projects": ["Algebraic-Jacobian-Challenge-Rebuild"]}, "audience": "horizon", "author": "horizon", "source_ref": null, "created_at": "2026-08-12T09:33:27.942731+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-08-13T03:49:35.230567+00:00", "metadata": {"provenance": {"run": "0144", "session": "0005-horizon-ajcr-reviewer-full", "role": "horizon", "round": "1", "rounds": "9", "task": "ajcr-reviewer-full", "task_title": "Fully answer the two AJCR reviewer PDFs \u2014 land pic0_representableBy and the Jacobian headline", "projects": "Algebraic-Jacobian-Challenge-Rebuild,Algebraic-Jacobian-Challenge"}, "agent": "work-reviewer", "read_by": ["ajcr-reviewer-full"], "comments": [{"id": "C-0001", "item": "I-1981", "author": "horizon", "at": "2026-08-13T03:26:31.172482+00:00", "provenance": {"run": "0144", "session": "0010-horizon-ajcr-reviewer-full", "role": "horizon", "round": "3", "rounds": "11", "task": "ajcr-reviewer-full", "task_title": "Fully answer the two AJCR reviewer PDFs \u2014 land pic0_representableBy and the Jacobian headline", "projects": "Algebraic-Jacobian-Challenge-Rebuild,Algebraic-Jacobian-Challenge"}, "body": "Independent work-review of d9e6c6c805 + f54769e496 (run 0144 r3): both traps CHECKED AND PASSED \u2014 RankOneDivisorUniqueness is genuinely discharged.\n\n- Trap 1: base-discrepancy localization extracts the base Pic class and kills it on a basic open tied to each prime (not f=1); glue-backs genuine (eq_of_awaySpan_eq needs span=\u22a4 from quasi-compactness; mapAlgHom_injective_of_faithfullyFlat is classify-injectivity + effective-epi cancellation, flatness from EtaleCover.comap_surjective).\n- Trap 2: rank one enters irreplaceably via Module.existsUnique_unit_smul_of_forall_tmul_ne_zero fed by the presentation's four certificates; T3/T4 produce sections and fibre nonvanishing, neither restates uniqueness; interface file untouched, wrappers close hu.\n- Kernel audit re-run independently: all six endpoints exactly [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]; no sorries; only the standard three per-file options; root-reachable via Pic0CriticalPath."}, {"id": "C-0002", "item": "I-1981", "author": "horizon", "at": "2026-08-13T03:49:26.886592+00:00", "provenance": {"run": "0144", "session": "0010-horizon-ajcr-reviewer-full", "role": "horizon", "round": "3", "rounds": "11", "task": "ajcr-reviewer-full", "task_title": "Fully answer the two AJCR reviewer PDFs \u2014 land pic0_representableBy and the Jacobian headline", "projects": "Algebraic-Jacobian-Challenge-Rebuild,Algebraic-Jacobian-Challenge"}, "body": "Consumed: RankOneDivisorUniqueness was discharged (d9e6c6c805) and the independent review above verified both traps against the landed proof. Archiving as consumed."}], "history": [{"at": "2026-08-12T09:33:27.945081+00:00", "actor": "horizon", "field": "created", "from": "", "to": "open", "note": "opened", "provenance": {"run": "0144", "session": "0005-horizon-ajcr-reviewer-full", "role": "horizon", "round": "1", "rounds": "9", "task": "ajcr-reviewer-full", "task_title": "Fully answer the two AJCR reviewer PDFs \u2014 land pic0_representableBy and the Jacobian headline", "projects": "Algebraic-Jacobian-Challenge-Rebuild,Algebraic-Jacobian-Challenge"}}, {"at": "2026-08-12T10:00:26.124336+00:00", "actor": "horizon", "field": "read_by", "from": "", "to": "read", "note": "", "provenance": {"run": "0144", "session": "0007-horizon-ajcr-reviewer-full", "role": "horizon", "round": "2", "rounds": "9", "task": "ajcr-reviewer-full", "task_title": "Fully answer the two AJCR reviewer PDFs \u2014 land pic0_representableBy and the Jacobian headline", "projects": "Algebraic-Jacobian-Challenge-Rebuild,Algebraic-Jacobian-Challenge"}}, {"at": "2026-08-13T03:49:35.233610+00:00", "actor": "horizon", "field": "status", "from": "open", "to": "archived", "note": "", "provenance": {"run": "0144", "session": "0010-horizon-ajcr-reviewer-full", "role": "horizon", "round": "3", "rounds": "11", "task": "ajcr-reviewer-full", "task_title": "Fully answer the two AJCR reviewer PDFs \u2014 land pic0_representableBy and the Jacobian headline", "projects": "Algebraic-Jacobian-Challenge-Rebuild,Algebraic-Jacobian-Challenge"}}]}}, {"id": "I-1982", "provider": "local", "kind": "issue", "body": "Phase-6 chart bridge is not glue; possible Zariski/etale mismatch at the translated-cover feeder\n\n- Design audit (run 0144 r3, signatures verified at HEAD): pic0_sepClosed_representableBy is NOT a composition of landed lemmas even granted PicRankOneOpen.IsOpen; the entry point is pic0RepresentableByOfAffineGenusCharts (Pic0AtlasFromDivRepAffChallenge.lean:188), and hf needs a theta reconciliation (no global iso: m0*classDeg = genus C need not be solvable; use per-index transport via picRankOneOpen_openPullback + chartValueAffTrans).\n- POSSIBLE BLOCKER: PointwiseCoverage needs Zariski-local chart points, but exists_sepClosedTranslated_mem_picRankOneOpen returns its witness over a finite separable extension L/kappa(t) (etale, not Zariski; kappa(t) n